        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hezekia kūsaata na kūnīlīīla SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Hezekia akasaata, ūsaaja ikanza iguhī ache. Ū ng'hangi Isaya, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Amozi, ūja koi; aho washika ūng'wīla, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Īgolanyage chiza ī mihayo ya ha ng'wako, nguno ūkūcha; ūtūpīlaga.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia ūgalūkīla kū ndugu ūnomba ū SEEBA alīhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ee SEEBA, izūkagwa ūmo nalūshimīzīlaga kū būtongi wako, mu būshikanu na ng'holò ya kwifunya kwa ng'hana; nū mu miso gako nalīītaga yawiza.” Ū Hezekia ūlīla mu kūsaatwa kūtaale no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Isaya aho ataalī nū kūfuma ū mu chumba sha ha gatī, ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wizīīla; gūng'wīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Shokaga ū kūlī Hezekia ū ntongeeji wa banhū bane ūkang'wīle gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa nkūlūgenji wako Daūdi alīhaya: Naakwigwaga ū kūlomba kwako, nī ī shisoji shako nashibonaga; nakūkūpīja. Mu lūshikū lwa kadatū, kwandīja lelo īyī, ūkūlinha kūja mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA wako.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūkongeja myaka ikūmi n'ītano a ha būlamu wako. Nīyo nakūkūpīja ū bebe nū nzengo gwenūyū kūfuma ū mu nkono gwa ntemi wa Ashulu. Nakūgūlwīlīīla ū nzengo gwenūyū kūlwa nguno yane, na kūlwa nguno ya ntūmami wane Daūdi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Isaya ūbawīla, “Shiginagi tiini, mubandīkīje a h'ibaale lyakwe akūpīla.” Aho bīīta ūpīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia akamūja ū Isaya, “Shikūbiza ho shimanīkījo kī sha koolecha gīkī ū SEEBA akūnipīja, nī gīkī ū mu lūshikū lwa kadatū, kūbala kwandīja lelo, nakūlinha kūja mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isaya ūng'wīla, “Ī mbeho ya numba, h'īkūbiza shimanīkījo sha gīkī ū SEEBA akwīta īyo wisagījaga; ūlītogwa īlīīhe kūja kū būtongi magūlū ikūmi, nūūlū īshoke kū numa magūlū ikūmi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia ūhaya, “Ī mbeho ū kūlīīha kūja kū būtongi magūlū ikūmi gūlī mhayo nogu, hambū hambū īshoke numa magūlū ikūmi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ng'hangi Isaya ūnomba ū SEEBA, ng'hana ū SEEBA wīyīta ī mbeho kūshoka kū numa magūl'ikūmi a ha malinhīlo ga ha numba ya ng'wa Ahabu ayo yalī yamala kūgakīlanhya kwika sīlīlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Batūmījiwa kūfuma Babuloni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ntemi wa Babuloni, Melodaki-baladani ng'witūnja o ng'wa Baladani ūtūma ū kūlī Hezekia nyalūba n'inong'ho, nguno akigwa gīkī ū Hezekia walī wasaatile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia ūbanukūla abo baalī baatūng'wa, nī shikolo īsho walī nasho mu mabīkīlo ga mu numba jakwe ūboolekeja pyī ī shose. Shikolo gītī, feza, zahabu, shisanjo sha mu shilīwa, na maguta ga ng'waso gwawiza, ūbingīnja nū mu chumba sha kūbīka shilanga; ūboolekeja pyī gete īsho walī nasho ū mu wibīkīja wakwe. Ū Hezekia atasaagije shikolo shose shose īsho ataboolekegije, hose pyī ū ng'wikūlū lyakwe, nū mu būtemi wakwe ū bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya yenīyo ū ng'hangi Isaya ūja ū kūlī ntemi Hezekia ūūkamūja, “A banhū benaba balūhayaga kinehe? Na baalī bafumaga halī?” Ū Hezekia ūhaya, “Bafumaga kū sī ya kūle; sī ya Babuloni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'hangi ūbūūja, “Babonaga shikolo kī ū ng'wikūlū lyako?” Ū Hezekia ūhaya, “Bashibonaga pyī ī shikolo sha ng'wikūlū lyane, shitīho shose shose ū mu shikolo sha mu mabīkīlo gane īsho nataboolekegije.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Isaya ūng'wīla ū Hezekia, “Alilūūlū degelekaga gūūyū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Līkūshika ikanza ī shikolo sha ng'wikūlū lyako shikūsolwa shitwalwe Babuloni, pyī nī shisho shakumingwa kwandīja mu shikū ja bataale bako kūshisha makanza aya. Shitūlekeelwa nūūlū shikolo shimò; h'ūmo alīhayīla ū SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na banhū bamò na bamò ba mu shibyalīlwe shako, abo balī mīlī na mininga gako gete, abo ūkūbyalīlwa; nabo bakūtwalwa bakabize basoloolwa ba ng'wikūlū lya ntemi wa Babuloni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia ūhaya, “Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo wagūhaya gwene gwawiza.” Akahaya gīko kūlwa nguno wiganikaga, “Tūhaya īkūbiza īlīho ī mhola a hene ū mu shikū jane?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Hezekia, pyī ī ya būtindi wakwe nū mumo akabeegeja ilambo, ūsīmba na ngoka gwa kwenha minzī mu nzengo; ī yose yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia wifuula hamò na bataale bakwe, ng'witūnja wakwe Manase ūbiza ntemi a ha ng'wanya gwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
